# WHAT IT COVERS: the first 2026-10-26 stream, 63.3 minutes cut to the gameplay its video shows,
# captured through Windows.Graphics.Capture (-wgc) with the blends drawn in linear light (-blend
# linear), which changes how a blend looks and nothing the replay models. The policy is the one
# the tree ships. The game hitched (20 to 100 ms) 602 times (571 an hour) and stalled for 100 ms
# or more 121 times (115 an hour), in 122 bursts, 69 of them with a stall, and with no periodic
# stretch. The lock released 3 times in the field, at 711.18, 1554.64 and 2872.97 s, and the
# replay releases at the same three moments. The worst blend run is 17 presents in the field and
# on the replay, where it sits at 3062.46 s. Of the 48 moves on the replay, 10 of them late, 14
# land more than 2 ms from a real frame.
# WINDOW. The video pairs with this log at log time = video time + 45.162 s, from the 2728
# marked frames in its first 45 s, within 0.38 ms of that offset (p90). The video runs 3796.6 s
# with no holes, opens on gameplay (indoors, then a view through a window over the village,
# marked) and ends on gameplay in the forest, so the cut is the whole video, 45.2 s to 3841.7 s of
# log time, and the marked frames lie inside it. After the video the relay ran on the desktop for
# about 9 minutes (31121 presents), left out. Inside the cut, 25 seconds in 25 runs fall out of
# the 60 fps regime, each a single hitch second.
# FIDELITY. The capture ran the policy the tree ships, so the two lines are comparable. The
# replay line reads synth 1.2% against 1.2%, worst run 17 against 17, runs >= 50 0 against 0 and
# pull wraps 105 against 104. On the dejitter arm, which is how the stream ran, blends are 2810
# against 2812, repeats 844 against 843, skips 287 against 287, pull wraps 98.7 an hour against
# 98.6 and the worst run 17 against 17. The replay makes 48 moves and the field's log has 48 in
# the window; the lock releases match within 0.34 ms.
# Bounds on the REPLAY (not the field): inequalities, so an improvement passes and only a
# regression fails. Measured on the policy the capture ran.
